  "rtText\">0%</small></div></div><div id=\"buttons\" hidden></div><div id=\"axes\" hidden></div></div><div class=\"card mapper\" id=\"mapper\"><div class=\"mapper-head\"><h2 style=\"margin:0\">Button Mapper</h2><div class=\"mapper-actions\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"mapAdd\" type=\"button\">+ Mapping rule</button><button id=\"mapExport\" type=\"button\">Export</button><button id=\"mapImport\" type=\"button\">Import</button><input type=\"file\" id=\"mapFile\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" hidden></div></div>\n<div class=\"rowline\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><label class=\"toggle\" style=\"margin:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mapE"
  "nabled\" checked> Enable mappings</label><span class=\"pilltag\" id=\"mapCount\">0 rules</span></div><div id=\"mapRules\"></div>\n<div class=\"mapper-dialog\" id=\"mapEditor\" hidden><h2 id=\"mapEditorTitle\">New mapping</h2><div id=\"mapCapture\" class=\"hint\">Press a physical button on your controller.</div><div class=\"rowline\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><button id=\"mapCaptureAgain\" type=\"button\">Capture input</button><span class=\"pilltag\" id=\"mapInputLabel\">Waiting\u2026</span></div>\n<div class=\"mapper-grid\"><label>Input<select id=\"mapSource\" class=\"mapper-select\"></select></label><label>Output 1<select id=\"mapOutput"
