  "gle\"><input id=\"mapRuleEnabled\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Rule enabled</label><button class=\"primary\" id=\"mapSave\" type=\"button\">Save rule</button><button id=\"mapCancel\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button></div><div class=\"hint\">A rule replaces its source's default output. Up to 3 outputs per input. Other default controls stay unchanged.</div></div>\n<div class=\"hint\" id=\"mapStatus\">Mappings are saved only in this browser. Cheats respond to the final mapped Xbox 360 outputs.</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"v13-panel\" id=\"v13Virtual\"><h2>Virtual Xbox 360 Controller</h2><div class=\"v13-info\">Touch or click but"
