  "dy</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"page-bottom\"><div id=\"controllerHint\">Connect a controller and press any button.</div><div id=\"gamepadDiagnostic\">Checking browser compatibility\u2026</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"remote\" hidden><div class=\"remote-scene\"><div class=\"remote-body\"><div class=\"remote-brand\"><span class=\"brand-led\"></span>TAV'S <b>X360</b></div><div class=\"remote-controls\"><button class=\"rbtn guide\" data-bit=\"10\" aria-label=\"Guide\">\u2715</button><div class=\"rrow smallpair\"><button class=\"rbtn\" data-bit=\"5\">\u25c0<small>BACK</small></button><button class=\"rbtn\" data-bit=\"4\">\u25b6<small>START</"
