  " Shot</h2><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"dropShot\" type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Crouch duration <b id=\"dropDurationLabel\"></b></label><input id=\"dropDuration\" type=\"range\" min=\"500\" max=\"2000\" step=\"50\" value=\"1000\"></div><div class=\"sub\">RT \u2192 B \u00b7 once per trigger hold</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"page-bottom\">Auto Clicker repeats while enabled and connected. Drop Shot holds B on RT press; games using a different crouch button may need remapping. Manual button holds take priority. All effects stop on disconnect.</div></section>\n\n<section id=\"macros\" h"
  "idden>\n<div class=\"v13-panel\"><h2>Macro Recorder</h2><div class=\"v13-tools\"><button id=\"v13RecStart\" class=\"v13-primary\">\u25cf Record mapped controller</button><button id=\"v13RecStop\" disabled>\u25a0 Stop & edit</button><button id=\"v13RecCancel\" disabled>Cancel</button><span id=\"v13RecStatus\" class=\"v13-info\">Ready to record</span></div><div class=\"v13-info\">Records button and trigger press/release timing from the mapped controller or virtual controller. Creates an editable routine in the existing Macros editor. Up to 40 actions / 60 seconds. Analogue stick recording is not included.</div></div>\n<div c"
  "lass=\"routine-toolbar\"><button class=\"primary\" id=\"macroNew\">+ New routine</button><button id=\"macroExport\">Export</button><button id=\"macroImport\">Import</button><input id=\"macroFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" hidden><button class=\"danger\" id=\"macroStopAll\">\u25a0 Stop all</button><span class=\"pill\" id=\"macroRunning\">Idle</span></div>\n<div class=\"routine-grid\" id=\"macroList\"></div>\n<div class=\"routine-editor\" id=\"macroEditor\" hidden><div class=\"routine-head\"><h2 id=\"macroEditTitle\">New routine</h2><button id=\"macroClose\">\u2715</button></div>\n<div class=\"routine-fields\"><label>Name<in"
  "put id=\"macroName\" maxlength=\"42\" placeholder=\"My routine\"></label><label>Trigger<select id=\"macroTrigger\"><option value=\"manual\">Manual</option><option value=\"button\">Controller button (mapped output)</option><option value=\"daily\">Local time \u00b7 daily</option><option value=\"interval\">Repeat every interval</option><option value=\"countdown\">Countdown from enable</option><option value=\"weather\">Weather condition</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"routine-fields\" id=\"macroTriggerFields\"></div>\n<div class=\"routine-fields\"><label>Repeat sequence<select id=\"macroRepeat\"><option value=\"1\">Once"
